<body><p><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW227316343 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space-collapse: preserve; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 26px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW227316343 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="paragraph" data-ccp-parastyle-defn="{&quot;ObjectId&quot;:&quot;aaed607e-c2a3-5841-9fb4-41037bfa0faf|1&quot;,&quot;ClassId&quot;:1073872969,&quot;Properties&quot;:[201342446,&quot;1&quot;,201342447,&quot;5&quot;,201342448,&quot;1&quot;,201342449,&quot;1&quot;,469777841,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777842,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777843,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777844,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,201341986,&quot;1&quot;,469769226,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,268442635,&quot;24&quot;,469775450,&quot;paragraph&quot;,201340122,&quot;2&quot;,134233614,&quot;true&quot;,469778129,&quot;paragraph&quot;,335572020,&quot;1&quot;,335559705,&quot;1043&quot;,335559740,&quot;240&quot;,201341983,&quot;0&quot;,134233118,&quot;true&quot;,134233117,&quot;true&quot;,469778324,&quot;Normal&quot;]}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">De richting waarin het team oplossingen onderzoekt, ligt niet van tevoren vast. Het doel van </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW227316343 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="paragraph" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">transdisciplinair</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW227316343 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="paragraph" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> leren is om innovatief te zijn, en dit brengt het risico met zich mee dat het team mogelijk niet veel vooruitgang boekt in de richting van een oplossing. Als ze ervoor kiezen om langer bij het probleem te blijven, kan dit ook zeer waardevol zijn, omdat er zo een beter begrip van het probleem vanuit verschillende perspectieven kan ontstaan. Vaak zijn oplossingen voor bepaalde problemen niet geschikt omdat het probleem verkeerd wordt begrepen. Daarom kan het begrijpen van het probleem of het erkennen van de complexiteit ervan een cruciale uitkomst zijn. </span></span><span class="LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW227316343 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space-collapse: preserve; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 26px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span class="SCXW227316343 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; text-wrap-mode: nowrap !important;">&nbsp;</span><br class="SCXW227316343 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; text-wrap-mode: nowrap !important;"></span><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun EmptyTextRun SCXW227316343 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space-collapse: preserve; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 26px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;"></span><span class="LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW227316343 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space-collapse: preserve; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 26px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span class="SCXW227316343 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; text-wrap-mode: nowrap !important;">&nbsp;</span><br class="SCXW227316343 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; text-wrap-mode: nowrap !important;"></span><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW227316343 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space-collapse: preserve; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 26px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;">Meer over deze onzichtbare uitkomsten lees je op de </span><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW227316343 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space-collapse: preserve; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 26px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;">theorie-pagina</span><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW227316343 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space-collapse: preserve; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 26px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;">. De </span><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW227316343 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space-collapse: preserve; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 26px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;">praktijk-pagina</span><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW227316343 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space-collapse: preserve; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 26px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;"> biedt voorbeelden van dit soort resultaten.</span><span class="LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW227316343 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space-collapse: preserve; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 26px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span class="SCXW227316343 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; text-wrap-mode: nowrap !important;">&nbsp;</span><br class="SCXW227316343 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; text-wrap-mode: nowrap !important;"></span></p></body>
